## Quick Commands

```bash
# Status check
systemctl status {{ webserver | default('nginx') }} ufw fail2ban php{{ php_version }}-fpm

# View logs
{% if webserver == 'nginx' %}tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log
{% elif webserver == 'apache2' %}tail -f /var/log/apache2/error.log
{% elif webserver == 'openlitespeed' %}tail -f /usr/local/lsws/logs/error.log
{% else %}tail -f /var/log/syslog
{% endif %}
tail -f /opt/monitoring/uptime.log

# SSL renewal
certbot renew --dry-run

# Backup
/usr/local/bin/backup-files.sh

# Firewall
sudo ufw status verbose
```

## Security Notes

- SSH password auth: **DISABLED**
- Root login: **key only** (`{{ ssh_permit_root_login }}`)
- UFW policy: **deny incoming**, allow SSH/HTTP/HTTPS
- Fail2Ban: bantime={{ fail2ban_bantime }}s, maxretry={{ fail2ban_maxretry }}

